床前明月光 ， 疑是地上霜\n[Chorus]\n举头望明月 ， 低头思故乡"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "歌词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [504.97711181640625, 568.5399169921875], "pos": [-49.1525993347168, -46.713809967041016], "id": 58, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [210, 82], "pos": [2583.119873046875, -598.0082397460938], "widgets_values": ["JZLX", "flac"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 112, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}], "flags": {}, "id": 61, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# YuE2: Text to Music\n\nYuE2是一种音乐生成模型，能够根据音乐风格和歌词创建包含人声和器乐伴奏的完整歌曲。\n\n启用ABC规划后，YuE2首先创建可编辑的符号化音乐计划(旋律及可选和弦)，然后根据该计划生成最终音频。\n\n## 模型链接 \n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n\n## 模型存储位置\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n```\n\n## 如何使用\n\n1. 写出你想要**音乐风格**的描述。\n2. 在歌词中使用 `[Verse] `和 `[Chorus] `等章节标签输入你的**歌曲歌词**。\n3. 选择一个**规划模式**。\n4. 设置**最大时长**。\n5. 运行工作流程以生成歌曲。\n\n\n描述主要的音乐特征，例如:\n\n\n## 撰写风格\n\n描述主要的音乐特征，例如:\n- **音乐类型:** 流行、爵士、摇滚、电子、民谣\n- **人声:** 温暖的女声、富有表现力的男声、柔和的人声\n- **语言:** 英语、中文、日语等。\n- **速度:** 90BPM，缓慢，欢快\n- **乐器:** 钢琴、电吉他、贝斯、鼓、合成器\n\n示例:\n\n\n> 英语，温暖的女声，当代流行音乐，96BPM，钢琴，圆润的电贝斯，克制的鼓点，清晰的发音\n\n将音乐描述放在**风格**中，而不是歌词中。\n\n## 写歌词\n\n使用章节标签来描述歌曲结构:\n\n\n    [Verse]\n    晨光透过窗户\n    城市在下方苏醒\n\n    [Chorus]\n    和我一起在阳光下奔跑\n    将阴暗远远地抛开\n\n你可以通过以下部分来构建歌曲结构:\n\n`[Verse]` · `[Chorus]` · `[Bridge]` · `[Outro]`\n\n仅在歌词字段中输入需要演唱的歌词。\n\n## ABC规划\n\n**完整版**\n\n在生成歌曲之前，创建一个包含**旋律和和弦**的象征性计划。推荐用于一般文本到音乐的生成。\n\n**旋律**\n创建一个**仅旋律**的计划，并允许伴奏更自由地生成。\n\n禁用 **ABC规划** \n直接从风格和歌词生成音乐，而无需创建象征性计划。\n\n## 最大持续时间\n\n设置生成歌曲的最大持续时间(秒)。\n\n歌曲可能因生成的音乐结构和歌词而提前结束。\n\n##提示词指南\n\n为了获得更好的效果，请清晰地描述音乐意图，并保持风格和歌词分开:\n\n**风格**\n`语言+风格+声乐特征+节奏+乐器+音乐特性`\n\n*歌词**\n\n使用章节标签，并仅书写需要演唱的歌词。\n\n##了解更多\n\n\n- [YuE2 提示词指南](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/docs/generation.md)\n- [YuE2 音乐技能](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/SKILL.md)\n- [生成与翻唱参考](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/references/generation-and-covers.md)\n\n## 报告问题\n\n注意:请先更新ComfyUI ([更新指南](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui))并准备所需模型。桌面/云端更新遵循稳定版本发布，因此部分预览版可能不支持。\n\n-无法运行/运行时错误: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n\n-UI/前端问题: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n\n-工作流问题: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [597.1212768554688, 1034.3232421875], "pos": [-926.3170166015625, -650.3615112304688], "id": 62, "properties": {}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.52.7", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1254.3869376192533, 729.9768447206568], "scale": 0.9646149645000016}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "fon